				{
					"id": 411430101,
					"content": "我這就送過去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411430102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411430102,
					"content": "#那就最好了，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411430103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 411430103,
					"content": "送的時候千萬要小心一些，<color=#00E1FFFF>別讓它沾了奇怪的元素</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411430104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 411430104,
					"content": "還有<color=#00E1FFFF>千萬繞著魔物走，別被它們把菜撞翻了</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411430105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 411430105,
					"content": "好了，快點把這道菜送過去吧，涼了就不好吃了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
